title: "CVPosh MCP connector (gemini-extension)"
type: software
abstract: "CVPosh is a resume and CV builder with an MCP server built for AI agents: your agent reads your saved CVs, scores them for ATS compatibility and compares them with a job posting, and you review and edit the result."
